## Information Gaps

- Active ingredient name is not explicitly stated on the Aerius product page; only dosage strength and uses are visible.
- Several products (e.g., Nepvol, Aerius) omit contraindications, side effects, and storage conditions.
- Constructed product_detail_link values are not verified; they require validation against live listings or link harvesting.
- Subcategory summaries may overlap with page-based products; deduplication policies need confirmation during production runs.
- Final deduplication and brand normalization rules must be codified prior to serialization.
- Mapping from the current inventory to the strict sequential product IDs (1…2280) relies on enumeration rules that require confirmation during the sequence assembly milestone.

